        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 2:01AM EDT until September 25 at 2:00PM EDT by NWS Newport/Morehead City NC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 15 to 25 kt with occasional gusts up to 35
kt and rough waters.

* WHERE...Pamlico, Pungo, Neuse, and Bay Rivers.

* WHEN...Until 2 PM EDT Friday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
